{"version":1,"key":"card:88","content":{"id":88,"content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"1b2dd7b3-29da-4227-b1d2-6099b44d3d5b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"背景"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1ced0c7b-a2c1-45d4-a74b-0f92a5df6fb5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"今天我突然想开一个新的账户，专门用来写一些电子书，在通过电子邮箱创建了另一个账户之后，第一件事就是为这个账户添加一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ssh"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的公钥，这样就不用每次提交都要输入密码了，但是当我试图直接将我电脑上的公钥提交时，它提示我这个公钥已经存在，这是我另一个 Github 账户使用的公钥，这使我意识到不同的账户不能使用相同的公钥。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"4633afa0-7fda-4e3f-8f78-b149d3c5d157","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决办法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac43ea09-5c12-4ed5-9164-51ad511df5ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先需要为新账号生成新的公钥和私钥"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"42bcdb51-1817-4940-91cd-7564a2fa337e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8ea8e2c3-54ed-46a8-bc54-a8ddb66176f1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"ssh-keygen -t rsa -f ~/.ssh/id_rsa_bookonly -C \"youremail\"","collabId":"0162bf8d-4635-472d-9170-1b8a0cc376d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f631da88-3ef5-47b6-9603-735fa1561ff1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后就可以在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":".ssh"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件夹中看到生成的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"id_rsa_bookonly"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"id_rsa_bookonly.pub"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件，现在我们将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"id_rsa_bookonly.pub"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的文件内容添加到创建的 Github 账户中。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"007c705b-524d-4449-aa84-8d16e6e1e86f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"添加完之后需要编辑 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"~/.ssh/config"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件，添加以下配置："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"","uuid":"d2491f83-7ff7-4287-ab59-3a8d2e1835fa","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"26dff180-fd55-4460-a043-b420f76d6695","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"Host book.github.com\n  HostName github.com\n  IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_rsa_book","collabId":"d49eff62-9000-4e26-9110-ad3db6c0b62b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2a8222c2-ba6b-433e-a391-3f731914d27d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"配置文件还是很容易看懂的，它的 Host 设置为了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"book.github.com"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以使用第二个账号下载和上传仓库的时候写法要进行改变"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"8beade9e-11de-4d9e-a48a-047bf1b21fc5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ac911692-051b-413d-9191-e18dc54c4858","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"git clone git@github.com/User/Repo -> git clone git@book.github.com/User/Repo\ngit remote add origin git@github.com/User/Repo -> git remote add origin git@book.github.com/User/Repo","collabId":"03b803c5-62da-4c0c-bea1-5658b0a44b9d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Github/技巧","技巧/Github"],"createTime":1689173634706,"updateTime":1752924215620,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752924215620}}